# FX Regime Lab — Cursor Rules

## Read First

Always read ARCHITECTURAL_BLUEPRINT.md before starting any task. Use MOC.md for navigation.

Production Next.js frontend is in **`/web`**. Design prototypes are in **`claude-design/`**.

## Hard Rules — Python

- All Supabase writes through `pipeline/src/db/writer.py` only
- All AI calls through `pipeline/src/ai/client.py` only
- mypy strict on all pipeline code
- Ruff lint on all pipeline code

## Hard Rules — Web

- Strictly use generated Supabase types from `web/src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts`.
- No soft shadows, no rounded corners (Institutional Aesthetic).
- All financial data must use `tabular-nums`.

## File Location Map

| Need to... | Go to... |
|------------|----------|
| Add a fetcher | `pipeline/src/fetchers/` |
| Add a signal | `pipeline/src/signals/` |
| Change regime logic | `pipeline/src/regime/` |
| Change AI prompts | `pipeline/src/ai/client.py` |
| Write to DB | `pipeline/src/db/writer.py` |
| Change Frontend | `web/src/` |
| Understand target UX | `claude-design/` |
